  "info": {
    "title": "Travel Budget mobile HTTP API",
    "version": "v1",
    "description": "Contract version, independent of application version. Native client; no cross-origin browser access. Refresh rotation is single-use; replay revokes the device session. Absolute 30-day lifetime, 15-minute access token. Logout uses refreshToken. Dates are date-only; money is TWD rounded by existing services."
  },
